{
  "html": "<main><section class=\"page\"><div class=\"page-head\"><div><h1>工具</h1><p>按需查找，再读取参数定义与执行调用。</p></div><span class=\"badge accent\">渐进发现</span></div><div class=\"filter-row\"><label class=\"field\">工具来源<select><option value=\"\">全部服务</option><option value=\"native-echo\">native-echo</option></select></label><label class=\"search-box\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">⌕</span><input aria-label=\"搜索全部工具\" placeholder=\"搜索工具名称、说明或服务\"></label></div><div class=\"tools-list\"><details class=\"tool-entry\"><summary class=\"tool-summary\"><span class=\"chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\">›</span><span class=\"grow\"><strong>echo</strong><small>Echo a supplied text message</small><small>native-echo · live</small></span><span class=\"badge good\">允许调用</span></summary><div class=\"tool-content\"><div class=\"tool-access\"><span>最终调用受此权限控制</span><label class=\"check-row\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\">允许调用</label></div><table class=\"param-table\"><thead><tr><th>参数</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>text</code><span class=\"required\"> 必填</span></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>—</td></tr></tbody></table><details class=\"schema-details\"><summary>查看完整 JSON Schema</summary><pre>{\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"text\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"text\"\n  ],\n  \"type\": \"object\"\n}</pre></details><form><label class=\"field\">调用参数 <small>JSON 对象</small><textarea class=\"code-input\" spellcheck=\"false\" rows=\"4\" value=\"{}\"></textarea></label><p class=\"note\">调用会实际执行此上游工具，请先核对参数与操作影响。</p><button class=\"control\">执行调用</button></form><!----><!----></div></details></div></section></main>",
